    clip_norm: A 0-D (scalar) `Tensor` > 0. A maximum clipping value, also
      floating point.
      Note: If a negative clip_norm is provided, it will be treated as zero.
    axes: A 1-D (vector) `Tensor` of type int32 containing the dimensions to use
